  "Question": "Circle \\(O\\) has radius 3, and \\(OP=5\\). \\(PA\\) and \\(PB\\) are tangents to circle \\(O\\), with points of tangency \\(A\\) and \\(B\\). Find the area of quadrilateral \\(PAOB\\).",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "12",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
